WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Interfaces are places where systems exchange force, energy, heat, space or information. They need explicit assumptions.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Connect a wheel-speed sensor to a controller: the interface carries a signal, not mechanical torque.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
System map

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A block diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of legal roadworthiness.

